# Local release staging directories only. The leading slash anchors the rule to the
# repository root, so design-archive/release-history/ is not swallowed by it.
# 仅忽略仓库根目录下的本地发布暂存目录；前导斜杠把规则锚定在根目录，
# 避免 design-archive/release-history/ 被一并忽略。
/release-*/
/release/

# Raw desktop reconnaissance dumps contain personal window titles and paths.
# 原始桌面侦察 dump 含个人窗口标题与路径：只在本地归档，不入仓库。
design-archive/probes/
design-archive/winrt-scratch/
